      "message": "Axios 1.x response interceptors fire in reverse registration order (last-in, first-out). The comment says \"registered before setupCache so this runs first\" — but reverse order means registering before actually makes it run last. Please verify the ordering is working as intended and update the comment to match the actual Axios behavior.",
